{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大埔吐露港公路有電單車懷疑失控，39歲男司機跌出車外，再遭私家車撞到，送院後不治。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">意外晚上約7時半發生，行車記錄片段可見，電單車司機倒臥在快線的地上，前方有三輛私家車。涉事白色電單車，就在司機位置前方較遠的中線翻側。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TP-2230_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026tblPIXmeBt1785424182.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.TP-2230_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當時電單車正往九龍方向行駛，到近運頭塘邨對開發生意外，後方的私家車懷疑收掣不及，撞到電單車司機，電單車司機昏迷，送院後證實不治。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方暫以危險駕駛引致他人身體受嚴重傷害，拘捕54歲私家車男司機。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TP-2230.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026A1NrdA5jyj1785423816.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.TP-2230.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T15:20:07.943821+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}